 "comment": "Keybound Brawler's casters, big enemies and summoned enemies as retail played them (Connor's Chronofoil captures of 2026-11-03 to 11-09, 223 runs; the working notes: notes/keybound-brawler.md in kawari-diagnostics). `casters`: what an enemy casts once it has its words (`after` seconds later; `actions` one each among those of its kind on the field; `counter` the stacks of status 5354 a word takes one off, the cast broken at none; `damage` to the barrier as it completes; `warn` the status every player gets for 2 s as it completes and `lock` the parameter of status 5347 a player's client then asks for; `then` what the caster does after: walk on (nothing), `fall`, `leave`, or `become` another kind). `adds`: a summoned enemy's first moments, in seconds from its SpawnNpc (`appear` [action, when, effect kind]; `hit` [action, damage, when] at the barrier; `words` when it gets its words; `blast` [action, damage] as it reaches the barrier, and it's gone; `death` its own action as it falls; `control` an ActorControl as it gets its words; `spots` where its kind stands, [x, z]; `charge` a barrier's-words object, filled by words instead of felled). `scripts`: a big enemy's rotation from `start` seconds after it gets its words: one of `paths` (block names in order, from `loop_from` again at the end; a path listed twice is picked twice as often: the last boss's first part was `three` 82 times, `one_again` 64, `one` and `two` 36 each, and its second one of the other pair), each block `length` seconds of steps (`cast` with its `time`, and `helper` [action, damage, [seconds after it completes]] the blows that follow from the helper 9020; `act` an action at once, with an `effect` of that kind on itself or none; a cast's own `effect` is of kind 27 unless said; `spawn` with its `rule`: `columns` one in each column, each in a different row; `front` one in the front row; `all` every spot; `free` spots no one stands on; `state` [notice, its argument, switch] for so many seconds; `words` the barrier's-words object; `shield_off` the barrier's shield gone); `every` a spawn repeated. A `state`'s fourth number is the parameter of the status (its argument) every player has while it lasts: retail gave it with the notice (EffectResult from the cast 1.6 s before: 5348 [1171] for 28 s after 49547, 5472 [1172] for 30 s after 49701, every one of 340). `effect_after`: how long after an action's effect packet its result came (EffectResult or EffectResultBasic with the same sequence; the commonest of each action's, within 0.02 s of each other): the barrier's HP (the director's 0x10000004) came 0.045 s before that. Actions not listed had no result packet, and their damage came with the effect.",
